=== stage1: vadd.vv lane 隔离实验（SEW=8，验证字节间不互相进位）===
2026-11-07T21:11:20+08:00

--- 程序 tests/hello/vadd_lane_isolation.c ---
  每个用例：vle8.v 装载两个 16 字节向量 -> vadd.vv -> vse8.v 存回，打印 16 字节结果
  A: a[0]=0xFF b[0]=0x01，其余 0        -> 若进位串位，out[1] 会是 01
  B: a[1]=0xFF b[1]=0x01，左右 lane 有值 -> 若进位串位，out[2] 会是 01
  C: 16 个 lane 全 0xFF + 全 0x01       -> 期望全 00
  D: 全 0x01 + 全 0x01                  -> 期望全 02（证明加法生效）

--- 关键指令 ---
      80000160:	02058087          	vle8.v	v1,(a1)
      80000164:	02078107          	vle8.v	v2,(a5)
      80000168:	021101d7          	vadd.vv	v3,v1,v2
      8000016c:	020401a7          	vse8.v	v3,(s0)
      8000019c:	02058087          	vle8.v	v1,(a1)
      800001a0:	02078107          	vle8.v	v2,(a5)
      800001a4:	021101d7          	vadd.vv	v3,v1,v2
      800001a8:	020401a7          	vse8.v	v3,(s0)
      800001d8:	02058087          	vle8.v	v1,(a1)
      800001dc:	02078107          	vle8.v	v2,(a5)
      800001e0:	021101d7          	vadd.vv	v3,v1,v2
      800001e4:	020401a7          	vse8.v	v3,(s0)
      80000214:	02058087          	vle8.v	v1,(a1)
      80000218:	02078107          	vle8.v	v2,(a5)
      8000021c:	021101d7          	vadd.vv	v3,v1,v2
      80000220:	020401a7          	vse8.v	v3,(s0)

--- NEMU 输出 ---
A lane0 溢出  in[0..3]=ff 00 00 00  out=00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
B lane1 溢出  in[0..3]=11 ff 22 00  out=22 00 44 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
C 全 lane 溢出  in[0..3]=ff ff ff ff  out=00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
D 常规 01+01  in[0..3]=01 01 01 01  out=02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02

--- RTL 输出 ---
A lane0 溢出  in[0..3]=ff 00 00 00  out=00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
B lane1 溢出  in[0..3]=11 ff 22 00  out=22 00 44 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
C 全 lane 溢出  in[0..3]=ff ff ff ff  out=00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
D 常规 01+01  in[0..3]=01 01 01 01  out=02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02 02

--- 两端是否一致 ---
  一致
